Z||000027||burdell1||11-10-2000||10:35 AM||||"Now I am a registered Democrat and come from a very long line of yellow dog Democrats down in GA. My family has been in politics for over 100 years and some of them worked for Carter as both Governor and President. Now my<BR>family is not too happy because I have voted Republican in presidential elections since I was old enough to vote (I'm 36 now)."--Songman<P>This makes no sense....if you are a registered Democrat, why are you voting Republican?<P>||||reg||1
