Z||000087||Oreif||11-15-2000||11:40 AM||||So right now the score is:<P>Original count ~ Winner GWBush (by 1700 votes)<BR>First Recount ~ Winner GWBush (by 327 votes)<BR>Second Recount ~ Winner GWBus (by 300 votes)<P>HMMM and now they want more recounts?!?<P>Am I missing something here? isn't  "Third times a charm" and "3 strikes and your out"?<P>Right now I don't care who wins, Just stop this media madness. If the absentee ballots are so important, why not just leave everything as it is and wait until Friday at midnight. Than add up all the absentee ballots and be done with it. I have a can of Pepsi that says next week someone is going to want to investigate the absentee ballots to make sure they were sent in by real american voters. Probably they'll want to interview each overseas voter!<P>I wonder what all this election madness is costing us the tax payers?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Maybe both candidates should foot the bill. Then at least it would end soon.||||reg||4
